{"id":50897,"date":"2026-04-28T09:19:38","date_gmt":"2026-04-28T08:19:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-madrid\/"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:16:08","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:16:08","slug":"maratona-madrid","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-madrid\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Madrid 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Madrid 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Madrid 2027<\/strong> e a <strong>Meia Maratona de Madrid 2027<\/strong> \u2014 integradas na ic\u00f3nica <strong>Zurich Rock &#8216;n&#8217; Roll Running Series Madrid<\/strong> \u2014 realizam-se no domingo, <strong>25 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Madrid, Espanha<\/strong>. Distinguida com o selo <strong>World Athletics Gold Label<\/strong>, esta \u00e9 uma das provas de estrada mais vibrantes da Europa, reunindo mais de 40.000 corredores ao som de mais de 30 palcos e bandas de rock ao vivo distribu\u00eddos ao longo de todo o tra\u00e7ado urbano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida na ampla avenida do <strong>Paseo de la Castellana<\/strong> e meta monumental no <strong>Paseo de Recoletos<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 <strong>Plaza de Cibeles<\/strong>), o evento permite-te escolher entre tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias homologadas pela <strong>RFEA<\/strong>: a cl\u00e1ssica <strong>Maratona de Madrid (42,195 km)<\/strong>, a muito procurada <strong>Meia Maratona de Madrid (21,097 km)<\/strong> \u2014 ambas com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> por vagas de tempo \u2014 e a r\u00e1pida corrida de <strong>10 km<\/strong> com arranque \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong>. O percurso atravessa os grandes \u00edcones hist\u00f3ricos e arquitet\u00f3nicos da capital espanhola, passando pela zona financeira das <strong>Cuatro Torres<\/strong>, <strong>Est\u00e1dio Santiago Bernab\u00e9u<\/strong>, <strong>Gran V\u00eda<\/strong>, <strong>Puerta del Sol<\/strong>, <strong>Plaza Mayor<\/strong>, <strong>Pal\u00e1cio Real<\/strong> e a envolvente do <strong>Parque do Retiro<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada historicamente pela <strong>AD MAPOMA (Asociaci\u00f3n Deportiva MAPOMA)<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Rock &#8216;n&#8217; Roll Running Series<\/strong>, a prova oferece uma log\u00edstica de excel\u00eancia internacional, com abastecimentos regulares a partir do km 5, guarda-roupa, medalha de finalista e a grande feira do corredor <strong>Expodepor<\/strong> nos pavilh\u00f5es da <strong>IFEMA Madrid<\/strong> nos dois dias que antecedem a competi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Paseo de la Castellana \/ Paseo de Recoletos, Madrid, Espanha<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42,195 km), Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e 10 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">AD MAPOMA e Rock &#8216;n&#8217; Roll Running Series<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h19 (Maratona) \/ 3h00 (Meia Maratona) \/ 1h30 (10K)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/rocknrollmadridrun.com\/official-rules\/?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona de Madrid (42K)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Meia Maratona de Madrid (21K)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10K de Madrid<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realizam a Maratona e a Meia Maratona de Madrid 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Zurich Rock &#8216;n&#8217; Roll Running Series Madrid realiza-se no domingo, 25 de abril de 2027. A prova de 10 km parte \u00e0s 08h00, enquanto a Maratona (42,195 km) e a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) partem a partir das 09h00, organizadas em vagas (cajones) de acordo com o tempo previsto de cada atleta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Maratona de Madrid inclui oficialmente a dist\u00e2ncia de Meia Maratona (21 km)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. O evento integra simultaneamente tr\u00eas provas oficiais homologadas pela Real Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Espanhola de Atletismo (RFEA): a Maratona de Madrid (42,195 km), a Meia Maratona de Madrid (21,097 km) e a corrida de 10 km, partilhando a partida no Paseo de la Castellana e a chegada no Paseo de Recoletos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a Maratona e a Meia Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o Artigo 9 do Regulamento Oficial, a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 3h00 (com fecho de meta \u00e0s 13h24m52s). Na Maratona (42,195 km), o fecho oficial da meta ocorre \u00e0s 16h34m45s (aproximadamente 6h19 ap\u00f3s a partida da \u00faltima vaga \u00e0s 10h15).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que monumentos passa o percurso em Madrid?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 100% urbano e fechado ao tr\u00e2nsito, passando pelo Paseo de la Castellana, Cuatro Torres, Est\u00e1dio Santiago Bernab\u00e9u, Nuevos Ministerios, Gran V\u00eda, Puerta del Sol, Plaza Mayor, Pal\u00e1cio Real, Casa de Campo (na Maratona), margem do Parque do Retiro e Fonte de Cibeles at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta no Paseo de Recoletos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona a feira do corredor (Expodepor) para levantar o dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal, chip de cronometragem e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial decorre exclusivamente na feira do corredor Expodepor, instalada no centro de exposi\u00e7\u00f5es IFEMA Madrid, na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 corrida (23 e 24 de abril de 2027).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es, blocos de partida e seguro desportivo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas no portal oficial (rocknrollmadridrun.com) por lotes progressivos de pre\u00e7o. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es formalizadas at\u00e9 31 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 garantem a personaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do nome no dorsal e a atribui\u00e7\u00e3o do bloco de partida correspondente \u00e0 marca declarada. Todos os inscritos ficam cobertos pelo seguro e licen\u00e7a de dia da RFEA.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Madrid 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Paseo de la Castellana \/ Paseo de Recoletos, Madrid\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Madrid\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"AD MAPOMA e Rock 'n' Roll Running Series\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realizam a Maratona e a Meia Maratona de Madrid 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Zurich Rock 'n' Roll Running Series Madrid realiza-se no domingo, 25 de abril de 2027. A prova de 10 km parte \u00e0s 08h00, enquanto a Maratona (42,195 km) e a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) partem a partir das 09h00, organizadas em vagas (cajones) de acordo com o tempo previsto de cada atleta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A Maratona de Madrid inclui oficialmente a dist\u00e2ncia de Meia Maratona (21 km)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. O evento integra simultaneamente tr\u00eas provas oficiais homologadas pela Real Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Espanhola de Atletismo (RFEA): a Maratona de Madrid (42,195 km), a Meia Maratona de Madrid (21,097 km) e a corrida de 10 km, partilhando a partida no Paseo de la Castellana e a chegada no Paseo de Recoletos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a Maratona e a Meia Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De acordo com o Artigo 9 do Regulamento Oficial, a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 3h00 (com fecho de meta \u00e0s 13h24m52s). Na Maratona (42,195 km), o fecho oficial da meta ocorre \u00e0s 16h34m45s (aproximadamente 6h19 ap\u00f3s a partida da \u00faltima vaga \u00e0s 10h15).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Por que monumentos passa o percurso em Madrid?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 100% urbano e fechado ao tr\u00e2nsito, passando pelo Paseo de la Castellana, Cuatro Torres, Est\u00e1dio Santiago Bernab\u00e9u, Nuevos Ministerios, Gran V\u00eda, Puerta del Sol, Plaza Mayor, Pal\u00e1cio Real, Casa de Campo (na Maratona), margem do Parque do Retiro e Fonte de Cibeles at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta no Paseo de Recoletos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona a feira do corredor (Expodepor) para levantar o dorsal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal, chip de cronometragem e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial decorre exclusivamente na feira do corredor Expodepor, instalada no centro de exposi\u00e7\u00f5es IFEMA Madrid, na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 corrida (23 e 24 de abril de 2027).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es, blocos de partida e seguro desportivo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas no portal oficial (rocknrollmadridrun.com) por lotes progressivos de pre\u00e7o. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es formalizadas at\u00e9 31 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 garantem a personaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do nome no dorsal e a atribui\u00e7\u00e3o do bloco de partida correspondente \u00e0 marca declarada. Todos os inscritos ficam cobertos pelo seguro e licen\u00e7a de dia da RFEA.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66367,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,31,41],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50897","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-madrid-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-madrid-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50897","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50897"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50897\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70047,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50897\/revisions\/70047"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http